      "cooked": "<p>When I repair a fixed asset, the increased amount is debited to the fixed asset account. However, upon selling the asset, that same amount is incorrectly credited to the accumulated depreciation account instead of being cleared from the asset account.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/4/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153_2_690x314.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2WPv1fWsizzVngAgOjS58nK0laj\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153_2_690x314.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153_2_1035x471.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/4/14aace6cfb6ade7ed9e390405d8877e4d213e153_2_1380x628.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1597×727 35.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
